	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t02r0401_girl4_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ねえ　ごぞんじ？▼
コロボーシって　ポケモン　って
がっきみたいな　なきごえ　ですって！▽
いちど　きいてみたいな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T10:56:01" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T10:53:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ねえ　ご存知？▼
コロボーシって　ポケモン　って
楽器みたいな　鳴き声ですって！▽
一度　聴いてみたいな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T11:07:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T10:53:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀：ピアノ演奏
・コロボーシをみせるまで繰り返し
・コロボーシがいるときは
　続けてgirl4_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T08:12:18" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL4
お嬢様</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T10:53:50" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T07:15:08" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t02r0401_girl4_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなたと　いっしょに　いる
コロボーシの　その　なきごえ……▼
コロン　コロコロン♪　まるで
もっきん　みたいで　ステキ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-21T08:16:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたと　一緒に　いる
コロボーシの　その　鳴き声……▼
コロン　コロコロン♪　まるで
木琴みたいで　ステキ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-21T08:16:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
